      "title": "Retrospectively Reverse-Engineering Apple's Neural Engine",
      "url": "https://eiln.github.io/posts/ane.html",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49670032",
      "score": 159,
      "comments": 18,
      "author": "zdw",
      "published": "2026-09-12T07:54:03Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Decodes Apple Silicon's undocumented ANE microarchitecture, instruction sets, and memory-mapped I/O across A-series and M-series hardware generations.",
        "Examines private AppleNeuralEngine.framework APIs and driver communication to bypass high-level Core ML runtime constraints and overhead.",
        "Provides foundational insights for open-source AI frameworks like tinygrad and Asahi Linux to utilize bare-metal NPU acceleration."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
